   F(s)\,\circ\,b_X=b_Y \,\circ\,F(s) \ \ \forall s: X\rightarrow Y\}.$$ Then with the following pointwise operations $\mathrm{Nat}\,F$ is a unital $*$-algebra: $$\begin{aligned}
